OL,3,GNEWSADelayed leisure centre
OL,4,Arefurbishment to cost #8.7m
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than #8m is to be spent on
OL,7,Frefurbishing a leisure centre with no
OL,8,Fdate set as to when it will reopen,
OL,9,FHull City Council has said.
OL,11,FEnnerdale Leisure Centre shut in May
OL,12,F2025 and was originally expected to
OL,13,Freopen this year.
OL,15,FHowever, the council previously said it
OL,16,Fwould remain closed until 2027 "after
OL,17,Fmultiple sections of the swimming pool
OL,18,Fpipework were found in a significantly
OL,19,Fpoorer condition than initially
OL,20,Fexpected".
